name: Focused saved catalog output, full receipts and confirmation recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 2
expect: Protected review calls: 0
resize: 40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-40x12
ask: Does this allowance clearly permit only two separately invoked intercepted requests, with uncertain dollars and no new scans or review work?
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | allowance-approved
paste-file: @ART/invalid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Catalog draft failed | invalid-output
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
paste-file: @ART/generate-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Taint catalog draft: | partial-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/replay-draft-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 SAVED OUTPUT | draft-result
expect: priority 0
expect: 1 entry
expect-not: 1 entries
expect: Active catalog at draft creation:
expect: Truncated inspected source prefixes: 1
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 Full receipt | full-receipt
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 SAVED OUTPUT | result-restored
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: result-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: result-40x12
keys: NPage
