live-snap: result-reading-24-40x12
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Receipt | narrow-receipt
expect: Tab result
keys: End
live-snap: narrow-receipt-tail
expect: REPLAY · Receipt
expect: Tab result
expect: rows
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | narrow-result-restored
expect: Tab receipt
ask: Is the partial draft clear at all six sizes, with priority zero, exact prior catalog version, complete saved text, a pinned heading and row position, while the narrow footer keeps Tab and paging visible?
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/inputs-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Frozen catalog inputs | supplied-inputs
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART inputs
paste-file: @ART/replay-inputs-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 SAVED OUTPUT | input-result
expect: owned_input
expect: explicitly absent
